:: Deadwood Transport School []
<<nobr>>
<<set $location to 'deadwood_transport_school', $bus to 'elk', $outside to 0, $Transport.shop to 'school'>>
<<lanSwitch 'Driving school' '驾校'>><br><br>
<<deadwood-dynamicblock 'deadwood-transport-school'>>
<<set _transport to maplebirch.get('Transport'), _school to _transport.school, _school_revision to $Transport.school.revision>>
<<if Time.weekDay is 1 or Time.hour lt 9 or Time.hour gte 18>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      The reception desk is empty. The timetable on the wall lists classes from 09:00 to 18:00, Monday to Saturday.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      前台没有人。墙上的课程表写着周一至周六营业，时间为 09:00–18:00。
  <</language>><br><br>
  <<if $Transport.school.exam>><<run _school.abandon()>><</if>>
  <<deadwood-transport-return>>
<<elseif $id lte 0>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      The receptionist looks up from the register. "I'll need to see your ID before I can book you in."
    <<option 'CN'>>
      前台从登记簿上抬起头。“预约前得先看你的身份证。”
  <</language>><br><br>
  <<deadwood-transport-return>>
<<elseif _school.examActive>>
  <<include 'Deadwood Transport Road Test'>>
<<else>>
  <<if $Transport.school.exam>><<run _school.abandon()>><</if>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      A learner car reverses between cones outside the window. Helmets hang above a row of motorcycle keys behind the counter.
      <<if Weather.isSnow>>Snow has been cleared from a narrow strip in the yard. An instructor watches the learner through the glass, leaving the road lessons for another day.
      <<else>>From the next room, you hear an instructor pause a traffic video and ask which driver has right of way.<</if>>
      The receptionist pushes a form towards you. "Car or motorcycle?"
    <<option 'CN'>>
      窗外，一辆教练车正倒入锥筒之间。柜台后挂着几顶头盔，下面是一排摩托车钥匙。
      <<if Weather.isSnow>>院子里只扫出了一条窄道。教练隔着玻璃看着学员，路上的课程得另找时间。
      <<else>>隔壁传来教练暂停交通录像的声音，接着问学员该让哪辆车先走。<</if>>
      前台将表格推到你面前。“汽车，还是摩托车？”
  <</language>><br><br>
  <<icon 'transport/commuter-motorcycle.png'>><<lanLink ['Motorcycle training', '摩托车课程']>>
    <<set $Transport.school.category to 'motorcycle', $Transport.school.result to null, $Transport.school.revision += 1>>
    <<run Dynamic.render('deadwood-transport-school')>>
  <</lanLink>><<if $Transport.school.category is 'motorcycle'>> <<lanSwitch '(current course)' '（当前课程）'>><</if>><br>
  <<icon 'transport/saloon.png'>><<lanLink ['Car training', '汽车课程']>>
    <<set $Transport.school.category to 'motor_vehicle', $Transport.school.result to null, $Transport.school.revision += 1>>
    <<run Dynamic.render('deadwood-transport-school')>>
  <</lanLink>><<if $Transport.school.category is 'motor_vehicle'>> <<lanSwitch '(current course)' '（当前课程）'>><</if>><br><br>
  <<switch $Transport.school.result>>
    <<case 'applied'>>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          The receptionist checks your ID, takes a photograph and puts your signed application in an envelope.
          "It'll come back here. Come back tomorrow."
        <<option 'CN'>>
          前台核对了身份证，拍下你的照片，将签好的申请装进信封。
          “办好会寄回这里。明天来取。”
      <</language>><br><br>
    <<case 'collected'>>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          The receptionist hands you an envelope. Your photograph is printed on the provisional licence inside.
          "Bring that to your lessons."
        <<option 'CN'>>
          前台递给你一个信封。里面的临时驾照上印着你的照片。
          “上课时带着它。”
      <</language>><br><br>
    <<case 'study'>>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          You work through road signs and right of way, then watch clips of traffic approaching junctions.
          The instructor stops the video just before a delivery van pulls out. "There. That's when you need to notice it."
        <<option 'CN'>>
          你认过路标，练习判断路权，又看了几段路口的录像。
          教练在一辆送货车驶出来之前暂停画面。“这里。得在这个时候发现它。”
      <</language>><br><br>
    <<case 'theory_passed'>>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          You answer the questions and mark the developing hazards in the video clips.
          The examiner checks the result and slides a pass certificate across the desk.
        <<option 'CN'>>
          你答完选择题，又在录像中指出正在出现的危险。
          考官核对成绩，将合格证明推过桌面。
      <</language>><br><br>
    <<case 'theory_failed'>>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          The examiner circles the section you missed. "Revise this before you come back."
          The receptionist turns to the next available date in the booking diary.
        <<option 'CN'>>
          考官圈出你失分的部分。“回去把这里再看一遍。”
          前台翻了翻预约簿，替你指出下一次能报考的日期。
      <</language>><br><br>
    <<case 'lesson'>>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          <<if _school.record.licensed>>
            <<if $Transport.school.category is 'motorcycle'>>
              The instructor takes you through tighter bends and busier junctions. You practise holding a steady line,
              then return to the yard to work on emergency braking.
            <<else>>
              The instructor sets you a route through busy junctions, then asks you to park in a narrow space.
              You repeat the manoeuvre until you can judge the distance without a reminder.
            <</if>>
          <<elseif $Transport.school.category is 'motorcycle'>>
            You practise slow turns in the yard before following the instructor onto the road.
            Their voice crackles through the radio when you forget a shoulder check.
          <<else>>
            The instructor sits beside you while you practise junctions and parking.
            "Mirror, signal, then move," they say, tapping the dashboard when you rush the turn.
          <</if>>
        <<option 'CN'>>
          <<if _school.record.licensed>>
            <<if $Transport.school.category is 'motorcycle'>>
              教练带你经过更急的弯道和繁忙的路口。你练习保持路线稳定，
              然后回到院子里，继续练习紧急制动。
            <<else>>
              教练让你驶过几个繁忙的路口，再把车停进狭窄的车位。
              你反复尝试，直到能自己判断好距离。
            <</if>>
          <<elseif $Transport.school.category is 'motorcycle'>>
            你先在院子里练习慢速转弯，然后跟着教练上路。
            忘记回头检查盲区时，耳机里立刻传来教练的提醒。
          <<else>>
            教练坐在副驾驶座上，看你练习过路口和停车。
            “看后视镜，打灯，再动。”你转得太急时，教练敲了敲仪表台。
          <</if>>
      <</language>><br><br>
    <<case 'cbt'>>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          The morning starts with helmet fitting and vehicle checks. After practising balance, turns and emergency stops in the yard,
          you spend the afternoon on the road with the instructor speaking into your earpiece.
          They sign your basic training certificate before putting the keys away. "Keep the L plates on while you practise. Ride alone."
        <<option 'CN'>>
          上午先试戴头盔、检查车辆。你在院子里练习平衡、转弯和紧急停车，
          下午跟着教练上路，耳机里不时传来指示。
          收好钥匙前，教练签下基础培训证明。“练习时挂好 L 牌。自己骑。”
      <</language>><br><br>
    <<case 'module_1_passed'>>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          You weave between the cones, make the slow turn and stop inside the marked area.
          The examiner checks the final box. "That's the manoeuvres done. Bring this for the road test."
        <<option 'CN'>>
          你绕过锥筒，完成慢速转弯，将车停进指定区域。
          考官在最后一栏打勾。“场地这一项过了。路考时带上这张。”
      <</language>><br><br>
    <<case 'failed'>>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          <<if $Transport.school.report?.serious_faults gt 0>>
            "Stop here." The examiner ends the test early and points out the traffic you put at risk.
          <<else>>
            The examiner turns the marked sheet towards you. "A few things to work on before the next test."
          <</if>>
          The receptionist marks the earliest date you can return in the booking diary.
        <<option 'CN'>>
          <<if $Transport.school.report?.serious_faults gt 0>>
            “停在这里。”考官提前结束考试，指出了刚才被你危及的车辆。
          <<else>>
            考官将写满记号的表格转向你。“下次来之前，先把这几项练好。”
          <</if>>
          前台在预约簿上标出最早能复考的日期。
      <</language>><br><br>
    <<case 'passed'>>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          Back in the yard, the examiner puts the clipboard down. "That's a pass."
          You sign the form and collect the certificate. Your full licence will follow in the post.
        <<option 'CN'>>
          回到院子里，考官放下记录板。“通过了。”
          你签好表格，领到合格证明。正式驾照随后会寄来。
      <</language>><br><br>
    <<case 'bribed'>>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          You leave the folded notes beneath the test sheet. The examiner glances towards reception, then pockets them.
          A pen scratches across the disputed marks. "Take that to the desk."
        <<option 'CN'>>
          你将折好的钞票压在成绩单下面。考官朝前台瞥了一眼，将钱收进口袋。
          笔尖划掉了几处有争议的记号。“拿去登记吧。”
      <</language>><br><br>
    <<case 'tampered'>>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          While the examiner looks for the next booking, you use the pen beside the diary to alter a few disputed marks.
          At reception, the clerk checks the signature and stamps the result.
        <<option 'CN'>>
          考官查找下一份预约时，你拿起预约簿旁的笔，改掉了几处有争议的记号。
          前台核对签名，给成绩盖了章。
      <</language>><br><br>
    <<case 'refused'>>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          The examiner pushes the envelope back. "Keep your money."
          The receptionist makes a note beside your name and calls the police. "We'll take another booking from you in three days."
        <<option 'CN'>>
          考官将信封推回来。“把钱收好。”
          前台在你的名字旁做了记号，拨通警察局的电话。“三天后再来预约。”
      <</language>><br><br>
    <<case 'caught'>>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          The examiner returns before you can put the sheet back. They take it out of your hand and call reception over.
          Your next booking is struck out. The clerk picks up the phone and asks for the police.
        <<option 'CN'>>
          你还没把表格放回去，考官就回来了。考官从你手里抽走成绩单，叫来前台。
          你的下一次预约被划掉了。前台拿起电话，要求接通警察局。
      <</language>><br><br>
    <<case 'interrupted'>>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          The instructor closes the file. "We'll have to leave it there for today. Come back when you can finish the session."
        <<option 'CN'>>
          教练合上档案。“今天先到这里。能把课程上完的时候再来。”
      <</language>><br><br>
  <</switch>>
  <<if $Transport.school.report>>
    <<lanSwitch 'Driving faults: ' '驾驶小错：'>><span class='lblue'><<print $Transport.school.report.minor_faults>></span><br>
    <<lanSwitch 'Serious faults: ' '危险错误：'>><span class='red'><<print $Transport.school.report.serious_faults>></span><br><br>
  <</if>>
  <<if Time.days lt $Transport.school.penalty_until>>
    <span class='purple'>
      <<lanSwitch 'Your bookings are suspended for ' '预约暂停，还需等 '>>
      <<print $Transport.school.penalty_until - Time.days>><<lanSwitch ' days.' ' 天。'>>
    </span><br><br>
  <</if>>
  <<if !$Transport.school.provisional.issued>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        The application form asks for your name, address and ID number. A photograph and the £43 fee go in the same envelope.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        申请表要填姓名、住址和身份证号码。照片与 £43 手续费一起装进信封。
    <</language>><br><br>
    <<if _school.canApply>>
      <<capture _school_revision>>
        <<icon 'transport/licence.png'>><<lanLink ['Apply for a provisional licence (£43, 0:15)', '申请临时驾照（£43，0:15）']>>
          <<if maplebirch.get('Transport').school.attend('apply', _school_revision) and $passage is 'Deadwood Transport School'>>
            <<goto 'Deadwood Transport School'>>
          <</if>>
        <</lanLink>>
      <</capture>><br>
    <<elseif _school.canCollect>>
      <<capture _school_revision>>
        <<icon 'transport/licence.png'>><<lanLink ['Collect your provisional licence (0:15)', '领取临时驾照 (0:15)']>>
          <<if maplebirch.get('Transport').school.attend('collect', _school_revision) and $passage is 'Deadwood Transport School'>>
            <<goto 'Deadwood Transport School'>>
          <</if>>
        <</lanLink>>
      <</capture>><br>
    <<elseif $Transport.school.provisional.ready_day gt Time.days>>
      <i><<lanSwitch 'Your application is still being processed. Return in ' '申请还在办理，'>>
      <<print $Transport.school.provisional.ready_day - Time.days>><<lanSwitch ' days.' ' 天后回来。'>></i><br>
    <</if>><br>
  <<else>>
    <<if _school.record.licensed>>
      <span class='green'><<lanSwitch 'Full licence obtained' '已取得正式驾驶资格'>></span><br><br>
    <<else>>
      <<lanSwitch 'Theory preparation: ' '理论准备：'>><<print _school.record.study>> / 3<br>
      <<lanSwitch 'Supervised driving lessons: ' '实操课程：'>><<print _school.record.lessons>><br>
      <<if _school.record.theory>>
        <span class='green'><<lanSwitch 'Theory test passed' '理论考试已通过'>></span><br>
      <</if>>
      <<if $Transport.school.category is 'motorcycle'>>
        <<if _school.motorcycleLearner>>
          <span class='lblue'><<lanSwitch 'Basic motorcycle training completed' '摩托车基础培训已完成'>></span><br>
        <<else>>
          <<language>>
            <<option 'EN'>>
              Basic motorcycle training takes the whole day. A helmet and a learner motorcycle are supplied.
            <<option 'CN'>>
              摩托车基础培训要上一整天。驾校提供头盔和练习车辆。
          <</language>><br>
        <</if>>
        <<if $Transport.school.motorcycle.module_1>>
          <span class='green'><<lanSwitch 'Off-road manoeuvres completed' '场地考试已通过'>></span><br>
        <</if>>
      <</if>><br>
      <<if !_school.practicalWeather>>
        <<language>>
          <<option 'EN'>>
            The instructor looks out at the weather and hangs the keys back up. "We'll keep the vehicles in today. The classroom's still open."
          <<option 'CN'>>
            教练看了眼窗外，将钥匙挂回去。“今天先把车留在里面。教室照常开。”
        <</language>><br><br>
      <</if>>
      <<if _school.canStudy>>
        <<capture _school_revision>>
          <<icon 'transport/theory.png'>><<lanLink ['Study road rules and hazards (£30, 1:00)', '学习交规与危险判断（£30，1:00）']>>
            <<if maplebirch.get('Transport').school.attend('study', _school_revision) and $passage is 'Deadwood Transport School'>>
              <<goto 'Deadwood Transport School'>>
            <</if>>
          <</lanLink>>
        <</capture>><br>
      <</if>>
      <<if _school.canTheory>>
        <<capture _school_revision>>
          <<icon 'transport/theory-test.png'>><<lanLink ['Take the theory test (£23, 1:30)', '参加理论考试（£23，1:30）']>>
            <<if maplebirch.get('Transport').school.attend('theory', _school_revision) and $passage is 'Deadwood Transport School'>>
              <<goto 'Deadwood Transport School'>>
            <</if>>
          <</lanLink>>
        <</capture>><br>
      <</if>>
      <<if _school.canCBT>>
        <<capture _school_revision>>
          <<icon 'transport/helmet.png'>><<lanLink ['Complete basic motorcycle training (£160, 6:00)', '参加摩托车基础培训（£160，6:00）']>>
            <<if maplebirch.get('Transport').school.attend('cbt', _school_revision) and $passage is 'Deadwood Transport School'>>
              <<goto 'Deadwood Transport School'>>
            <</if>>
          <</lanLink>>
        <</capture>><br>
      <</if>>
      <<if _school.canModuleOne>>
        <<capture _school_revision>>
          <<icon 'transport/road-test.png'>><<lanLink ['Take the off-road test (£15.50, 0:20)', '参加场地考试（£15.50，0:20）']>>
            <<if maplebirch.get('Transport').school.attend('module_1', _school_revision) and $passage is 'Deadwood Transport School'>>
              <<goto 'Deadwood Transport School'>>
            <</if>>
          <</lanLink>>
        <</capture>><br>
      <</if>>
      <<if _school.canTest>>
        <<capture _school_revision>>
          <<icon 'transport/road-test.png'>><<lanLink ['Begin the road test (£' + _school.terms.test_fee / 100 + ', 0:45)', '开始道路考试（£' + _school.terms.test_fee / 100 + '，0:45）']>>
            <<if maplebirch.get('Transport').school.attend('test', _school_revision) and $passage is 'Deadwood Transport School'>>
              <<goto 'Deadwood Transport School'>>
            <</if>>
          <</lanLink>>
        <</capture>><br>
      <<elseif _school.record.theory and _school.record.retest_day lte Time.days and (_school.record.practice lt 200 or $Transport.driving lt 300)>>
        <i><<lanSwitch 'The instructor suggests some more supervised practice before your test.' '教练建议你先多练习几次，再预约考试。'>></i><br>
      <</if>>
      <<if _school.record.theory_retest_day gt Time.days>>
        <i><<lanSwitch 'Your next theory test can be booked in ' '理论考试还需等 '>>
        <<print _school.record.theory_retest_day - Time.days>><<lanSwitch ' days.' ' 天。'>></i><br>
      <</if>>
      <<if _school.record.retest_day gt Time.days>>
        <i><<lanSwitch 'Your next practical test can be booked in ' '实操考试还需等 '>>
        <<print _school.record.retest_day - Time.days>><<lanSwitch ' days.' ' 天。'>></i><br>
      <</if>>
      <<if _school.canAlter>>
        <br>
        <<language>>
          <<option 'EN'>>
            The examiner leaves your sheet beside the booking diary. The disputed marks have been crossed out and written in again.
            The receptionist is busy with another learner.
          <<option 'CN'>>
            考官将你的成绩单留在预约簿旁。有争议的几项被划掉，又重新写上。
            前台正忙着接待另一位学员。
        <</language>><br><br>
        <<if _school.canBribe>>
          <<capture _school_revision>>
            <<icon 'pound.png'>><<lanLink ['Offer £' + _school.terms.bribe_fee / 100 + ' to change the result (0:15)', '拿出 £' + _school.terms.bribe_fee / 100 + '，试着改掉成绩 (0:15)']>>
              <<if maplebirch.get('Transport').school.attend('bribe', _school_revision) and $passage is 'Deadwood Transport School'>>
                <<goto 'Deadwood Transport School'>>
              <</if>>
            <</lanLink>>
          <</capture>><br>
        <</if>>
        <<if _school.canTamper>>
          <<capture _school_revision>>
            <<crimeicon 'documents'>><<lanLink ['Alter the test sheet (0:15)', '偷偷改掉成绩单 (0:15)']>>
              <<if maplebirch.get('Transport').school.attend('tamper', _school_revision) and $passage is 'Deadwood Transport School'>>
                <<goto 'Deadwood Transport School'>>
              <</if>>
            <</lanLink>>
          <</capture>><br>
        <</if>>
        <<lanLink ['Leave the sheet alone', '把成绩单留在原处']>>
          <<set $Transport.school.attempt.resolved to true, $Transport.school.result to null, $Transport.school.revision += 1>>
          <<run Dynamic.render('deadwood-transport-school')>>
        <</lanLink>><br>
      <</if>>
      <<if !_school.available and Time.days gte $Transport.school.penalty_until>>
        <span class='purple'><<lanSwitch 'You are in no condition to take a lesson.' '你现在的状况不适合上课。'>></span><br>
      <</if>><br>
    <</if>>
    <<if _school.canTrain>>
      <<capture _school_revision>>
        <<icon `$Transport.school.category === 'motorcycle' ? 'transport/motorcycle-lesson.png' : 'transport/driving-lesson.png'`>><<lanLink [(_school.record.licensed ? 'Advanced driving practice' : 'Take a driving lesson') + ' (£' + _school.terms.lesson_fee / 100 + ', 1:00)', (_school.record.licensed ? '进阶驾驶练习' : '上实操课') + '（£' + _school.terms.lesson_fee / 100 + '，1:00）']>>
          <<if maplebirch.get('Transport').school.attend('lesson', _school_revision) and $passage is 'Deadwood Transport School'>>
            <<goto 'Deadwood Transport School'>>
          <</if>>
        <</lanLink>>
      <</capture>><br>
    <</if>>
  <</if>>
  <<deadwood-transport-return>>
<</if>>

<</deadwood-dynamicblock>>
<</nobr>>

:: Deadwood Transport Road Test []
<<nobr>>
<<set _school to maplebirch.get('Transport').school, _exam to $Transport.school.exam>>
<<if _school.examActive and _exam>>
  <<set _exam_step to _exam.step, _variant to _exam.variants[_exam_step]>>
  <<lanSwitch 'Road test' '道路考试'>> <<print _exam_step + 1>> / 4<br>
  <<lanSwitch 'Driving faults: ' '驾驶小错：'>><<print _exam.minor_faults>><br><br>
  <<if $Transport.school.category is 'motorcycle'>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        The examiner follows on another motorcycle. Their next direction comes through your earpiece.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        考官骑着另一辆摩托车跟在后面。耳机里传来下一条指示。
    <</language>><br><br>
  <<else>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        The examiner sits beside you, their pen resting against the clipboard.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        考官坐在你身旁，笔尖停在记录板上。
    <</language>><br><br>
  <</if>>
  <<switch _school.scene>>
    <<case 'junction'>>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          "Take the next left." A delivery van is parked close to the junction. Its rear doors block part of your view.
          <<if _school.hazardAware>>
            <<if _variant is 0>>
              You can see a car approaching from the right through the van's windows. It is too close to pull out ahead of it.
            <<else>>
              The van blocks your view to the right. From a little further forward, you would be able to see down the road.
            <</if>>
          <</if>>
        <<option 'CN'>>
          “下个路口左转。”一辆送货车停在路口旁，后门挡住了部分视线。
          <<if _school.hazardAware>>
            <<if _variant is 0>>
              透过货车的车窗，你看见右边正有一辆车驶近。距离太近，赶在它前面驶出去很危险。
            <<else>>
              货车挡住了右侧的视线。再往前挪一点，就能看清那边的路面。
            <</if>>
          <</if>>
      <</language>><br><br>
      <<capture _exam_step>>
        <<lanLink ['Wait at the give-way line (0:10)', '停在让行线前等待 (0:10)']>>
          <<if maplebirch.get('Transport').school.drive('wait', _exam_step) and $passage is 'Deadwood Transport School'>>
            <<goto 'Deadwood Transport School'>>
          <</if>>
        <</lanLink>><br>
        <<lanLink ['Edge forward slowly (0:10)', '慢慢向前挪动 (0:10)']>>
          <<if maplebirch.get('Transport').school.drive('edge', _exam_step) and $passage is 'Deadwood Transport School'>>
            <<goto 'Deadwood Transport School'>>
          <</if>>
        <</lanLink>><br>
        <<lanLink ['Pull out in one movement (0:10)', '一口气驶出路口 (0:10)']>>
          <<if maplebirch.get('Transport').school.drive('go', _exam_step) and $passage is 'Deadwood Transport School'>>
            <<goto 'Deadwood Transport School'>>
          <</if>>
        <</lanLink>><br>
      <</capture>>
    <<case 'passing'>>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          A cyclist rides ahead of you. Parked cars narrow the road, and the white line disappears around the bend.
          <<if _school.hazardAware>>
            <<if _variant is 0>>
              An oncoming car is about to reach the narrow stretch. There is room to follow the cyclist until it passes.
            <<else>>
              Beyond the bend, the road is clear. You can cross the centre line and leave the cyclist plenty of room.
            <</if>>
          <</if>>
        <<option 'CN'>>
          一位骑车人走在你前面。路边停放的车辆让道路变窄，白线消失在弯道后面。
          <<if _school.hazardAware>>
            <<if _variant is 0>>
              一辆对向汽车就要驶进这段窄路。先跟在自行车后面，可以等它过去。
            <<else>>
              弯道后面的路很空。越过中线时，能与骑车人拉开足够的距离。
            <</if>>
          <</if>>
      <</language>><br><br>
      <<capture _exam_step>>
        <<lanLink ['Stay behind the cyclist (0:10)', '继续跟在自行车后面 (0:10)']>>
          <<if maplebirch.get('Transport').school.drive('hold', _exam_step) and $passage is 'Deadwood Transport School'>>
            <<goto 'Deadwood Transport School'>>
          <</if>>
        <</lanLink>><br>
        <<lanLink ['Pass with plenty of room (0:10)', '拉开距离后超车 (0:10)']>>
          <<if maplebirch.get('Transport').school.drive('pass', _exam_step) and $passage is 'Deadwood Transport School'>>
            <<goto 'Deadwood Transport School'>>
          <</if>>
        <</lanLink>><br>
        <<lanLink ['Squeeze through beside the cyclist (0:10)', '挤到自行车旁边过去 (0:10)']>>
          <<if maplebirch.get('Transport').school.drive('squeeze', _exam_step) and $passage is 'Deadwood Transport School'>>
            <<goto 'Deadwood Transport School'>>
          <</if>>
        <</lanLink>><br>
      <</capture>>
    <<case 'roundabout'>>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          "Second exit." The lane arrows point straight ahead. A car on your right has its left indicator flashing.
          <<if _school.hazardAware>>
            <<if _variant is 0>>
              Despite the indicator, the car continues around the roundabout towards your entrance.
            <<else>>
              The car turns off before your entrance. The lane approaching from the right is now clear.
            <</if>>
          <</if>>
        <<option 'CN'>>
          “第二个出口。”车道箭头指向正前方。右边一辆车亮着左转向灯。
          <<if _school.hazardAware>>
            <<if _variant is 0>>
              那辆车虽然打着灯，却还在沿环岛驶来，正接近你的入口。
            <<else>>
              那辆车在你的入口前驶出了环岛。右边的车道已经空出来了。
            <</if>>
          <</if>>
      <</language>><br><br>
      <<capture _exam_step>>
        <<lanLink ['Wait for the car to clear (0:10)', '等那辆车通过 (0:10)']>>
          <<if maplebirch.get('Transport').school.drive('wait', _exam_step) and $passage is 'Deadwood Transport School'>>
            <<goto 'Deadwood Transport School'>>
          <</if>>
        <</lanLink>><br>
        <<lanLink ['Enter the roundabout (0:10)', '驶入环岛 (0:10)']>>
          <<if maplebirch.get('Transport').school.drive('enter', _exam_step) and $passage is 'Deadwood Transport School'>>
            <<goto 'Deadwood Transport School'>>
          <</if>>
        <</lanLink>><br>
        <<lanLink ['Move into the other lane first (0:10)', '先换到另一条车道 (0:10)']>>
          <<if maplebirch.get('Transport').school.drive('outer', _exam_step) and $passage is 'Deadwood Transport School'>>
            <<goto 'Deadwood Transport School'>>
          <</if>>
        <</lanLink>><br>
      <</capture>>
    <<case 'stopping'>>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          "Pull up somewhere safe along here." There is a gap between parked cars on the left, and another empty space further ahead.
          <<if _school.hazardAware>>
            <<if _variant is 0>>
              A bus stop sign stands beside the first gap. The space further ahead has no parking restrictions or driveways.
            <<else>>
              The first gap has no parking restrictions. The space further ahead sits right on the corner of a junction.
            <</if>>
          <</if>>
        <<option 'CN'>>
          “在这附近找个安全的地方停下。”左边停放的车辆之间有一段空隙，再往前还有一处空位。
          <<if _school.hazardAware>>
            <<if _variant is 0>>
              第一处空隙旁立着公交站牌。前面的空位没有禁停标志，也没有车道出入口。
            <<else>>
              第一处空隙旁没有禁停标志。前面的空位紧挨着路口转角。
            <</if>>
          <</if>>
      <</language>><br><br>
      <<capture _exam_step>>
        <<lanLink ['Check behind you and use the first gap (0:10)', '检查后方，停进第一处空隙 (0:10)']>>
          <<if maplebirch.get('Transport').school.drive('here', _exam_step) and $passage is 'Deadwood Transport School'>>
            <<goto 'Deadwood Transport School'>>
          <</if>>
        <</lanLink>><br>
        <<lanLink ['Check behind you and stop further ahead (0:10)', '检查后方，继续往前找地方停下 (0:10)']>>
          <<if maplebirch.get('Transport').school.drive('ahead', _exam_step) and $passage is 'Deadwood Transport School'>>
            <<goto 'Deadwood Transport School'>>
          <</if>>
        <</lanLink>><br>
        <<lanLink ['Brake sharply and pull straight in (0:10)', '猛踩刹车，直接靠边 (0:10)']>>
          <<if maplebirch.get('Transport').school.drive('hurry', _exam_step) and $passage is 'Deadwood Transport School'>>
            <<goto 'Deadwood Transport School'>>
          <</if>>
        <</lanLink>><br>
      <</capture>>
  <</switch>>
  <<if !_school.hazardAware>>
    <<capture _exam_step>>
      <<lanLink ['Look carefully at the traffic (0:01)', '仔细观察路况 (0:01)']>>
        <<if maplebirch.get('Transport').school.observe(_exam_step) and $passage is 'Deadwood Transport School'>>
          <<goto 'Deadwood Transport School'>>
        <</if>>
      <</lanLink>><br>
    <</capture>>
  <</if>><br>
  <<getouticon>><<lanLink ['Ask to stop the test', '要求结束考试']>>
    <<run maplebirch.get('Transport').school.abandon()>>
    <<run Dynamic.render('deadwood-transport-school')>>
  <</lanLink>>
<</if>>
<</nobr>>
